Package: clashdp
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: clashDP <clashdp@localhost>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), libc6 (>= 2.34), libgl1, libglib2.0-0, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libdbus-1-3, libx11-6, libx11-xcb1, libxkbcommon0, libxkbcommon-x11-0, libxcb1, libxcb-cursor0, libxcb-icccm4, libxcb-image0, libxcb-keysyms1, libxcb-randr0, libxcb-render-util0, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xkb1, libxcb-xinerama0, libxcb-sync1, libxcb-shm0
Recommends: libnotify4
Description: clashDP - mihomo (Clash.Meta) desktop GUI client
 A native desktop client for the mihomo (Clash.Meta) proxy kernel,
 written in Python + PySide6 and tuned for deepin 25 / arm64.
 .
 Features:
  - Manage the mihomo kernel (start / stop / config validation)
  - Subscription management with one-click update
  - Proxy group and node list with latency testing
  - System proxy switching via gsettings
  - Live traffic and connection monitoring
  - Built-in kernel log viewer with level filter
  - Optional TUN mode (kernel gets CAP_NET_ADMIN on install)
 .
 The mihomo kernel binary and GeoIP/GeoSite databases are bundled,
 so no network access is required on first run.
